            "responseMode": "Last Node",
            "initialMessage": "\ud83d\udc4b **Universal Contact Data Extraction Agent (Groq Edition)**\n\nUpload any format or paste text:\n- \ud83d\udcc4 **PDFs** (Business cards & directory lists)\n- \ud83d\udcca **CSVs** (Contact sheets & tables)\n- \ud83d\udcc7 **Business Cards** (JPG/PNG photos)\n- \ud83d\udcac **Text / Notes** (Direct pasted contacts)\n\nPowered by ultra-fast **Groq (`llama-3.3-70b-versatile`)** and saved to Google Sheets (`Contacts` tab)!",
